OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of veterans march past
OL,4,ACenotaph on Remembrance Sunday after
OL,5,AKing leads two-minute silence
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King leads the nation in a
OL,8,Ftwo-minute silence to mark Remembrance
OL,9,FSunday - watch the service above
OL,11,FThe monarch, joined at the service by
OL,12,Fthe Prince of Wales, also lays a wreath
OL,13,Fat the Cenotaph to remember those
OL,14,Fwho've died - why the memorial is
OL,15,Fsignificant
OL,17,FQueen Camilla and the Princess of Wales
OL,18,Fwatch on from a balcony above Whitehall
OL,19,F- our royal correspondent describes the
OL,20,Fservice as a moment of reflection in a
OL,21,Fchaotic world
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
