OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of veterans march past
OL,4,ACenotaph on Remembrance Sunday after
OL,5,AKing leads two-minute silence
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 10,000 armed forces veterans will
OL,8,Fsoon march through Whitehall, alongside
OL,9,Fabout 20 World War Two veterans
OL,11,FMeanwhile, Andy Burnham is joined at
OL,12,Fthe service by Tory leader Kemi
OL,13,FBadenoch and former prime ministers
OL,14,Fincluding Boris Johnson and Tony Blair
OL,16,FAway from the capital, services are
OL,17,Falso taking place in communities across
OL,18,Fthe UK, including in Edinburgh, Belfast
OL,19,Fand Cardiff
